# Private brand assets. This repository is a public fork, so the InfoAnalytica lockup and
# everything generated from it stay out of it. `pnpm brand` (scripts/apply-brand.mjs)
# regenerates all of these locally from ia_assets/logo.svg, and writes clearly-marked neutral
# placeholders when that master is absent, so a public clone still builds.
ia_assets/
build/
src/assets/logo-light-full.svg
src/assets/logo-dark-full.svg
src/assets/logo-light-icon.svg
src/assets/logo-dark-icon.svg
public/favicon.svg
docs/favicon.svg
docs/logo/
